title: "Predictive Maintenance for Autonomous Delivery Robots: ML & Decision Layer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zagaia
    given-names: Luca
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lucazagaia/Predictive-Maintenance"
abstract: >-
  Anomaly detection (MVT-Flow on voraus-AD) and remaining-useful-life estimation
  (Li et al. 1-D CNN on NASA C-MAPSS) fused by a thesis-derived decision matrix into a
  maintenance recommendation for autonomous last-mile delivery robots.
keywords:
  - predictive maintenance
  - anomaly detection
  - remaining useful life
  - normalizing flows
  - autonomous delivery robots
  - pytorch
